title: Line 39 is staged, then changed again on disk: unstaging at 39 must take only the staged change out of the index (index as committed there), the file keeps the newer text; staging at 39 afterwards puts the newer text in the index
folders: git-changes
expect-file: git-changes/src/steps.rs :: fn step_11\(\) -> u32 \{\n    eleven\(\)\+ 1\n\}
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1000
zoom 0.5
part stage src/steps.rs 39
wait 1500
edit src/steps.rs 39 13
type  + 1
key save
wait 1500
key escape
wait 500
mark 1-staged-and-changed-again
wait 500
part unstage src/steps.rs 39
wait 1500
mark 2-unstaged
wait 500
part stage src/steps.rs 39
wait 1500
mark 3-staged-newer
wait 500
quit
